# EVERY TEXT FILE IS LF, EVERYWHERE. This kit is built on Windows and runs on Linux: a CRLF install.sh does not
# execute there at all ("bash\r: command not found"), and a CRLF Dockerfile or .sql fails in subtler ways. The
# SharpSight repository carries the same rule, and a release was once broken for want of it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries, untouched.
*.png binary
*.jar binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.ssbi binary
*.zip binary
*.supx binary
# the built panel: what the bundle's checksum is taken over — byte for byte
studio/extension/frontend/dist/* -text
